<title>ITALY: Italy lira breaks 970/mark, highest since June '94.</title>
<headline>Italy lira breaks 970/mark, highest since June '94.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian lira firmed past 970 lire per mark on the foreign exchange markets and was quoted up at 969.80, its highest level since June 1994.</p>
<p>By 1618 GMT the lira was quoted at 970.20/0.55 per mark.</p>
